      <baseDesc>A short-handed crew aboard a coastal trading vessel relied on [PAWN_nameDef] to prepare meals from limited stores. [PAWN_nameDef] learned to cook well, but constant complaints from the crew left little patience for other people's demands.</baseDesc>
